Exercise: Add a New Vegetable to the Kitchen Garden

In this exercise, you will create a new class called Broccoli and add Broccoli objects to the KitchenGarden.

Requirements

Your Broccoli class must have:

3 attributes
A constructor with default values
A constructor with parameters
Getters
Setters
A __str__() method

After creating the class, create two Broccoli objects inside KitchenGarden and print them.
Please modify Broccoli.py og KitchenGarden.py classes.